{"availability":"available","full":"BeefreeSDK/beefree-sdk-docs","name":"beefree-sdk-docs","description":"Comprehensive documentation for the Beefree SDK — the most flexible and scalable embeddable builder for no-code email, landing pages, and popups. Integrate drag-and-drop editing into your app with full customization capabilities.","category":"Developer tools","language":null,"stars":2,"forks":3,"created":"2023-12-11T15:33:19Z","updated":"2026-10-09T16:05:29Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://docs.beefree.io/beefree-sdk","topics":["customizable-options","customizable-ui","docs-site","documentation","email","email-builder","email-editor","email-editor-for-saas-app","embeddable","landing-page","landing-page-builder","no-code","page","popup-builder","sdk"],"demo":"https://playground.beefree.io/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:03:13.932Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T09:03:13.932Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T09:03:13.932Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T02:35:47.475Z","stars":2,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-10T09:03:13.932Z","stars":2,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Beefree SDK is an embeddable no-code builder that gives your end users the freedom to design stunning emails, landing pages, and popups—without writing a single line of code. It’s easy to configure, intuitive to personalize, and built to scale with your needs—whether you're a startup or an enterprise. Built with both developers and end users in mind, it’s designed to integrate easily into your application, scale as your product grows, and provide a flexible, white-label design experience.","For developers, Beefree SDK is easy to work with. You can personalize the design experience by adding simple configuration parameters. Want to enable or disable a feature? Just check a box in the Developer Console, hit save, and the changes are immediately reflected on the frontend. No complicated setup required.","For your end users, Beefree SDK is an intuitive drag-and-drop editor with everything end users need to bring their creative ideas to life—whether they’re creating an email campaign, a landing page, or an attention-grabbing popup. Content blocks like titles, images, lists, tables, buttons, and more are all available right out of the box."],"features":["Email builder: A no-code email creation environment that helps end users quickly create beautiful emails. This environment supports your end users in following email creation best practices recommended by industry…","Page builder: A no-code landing page creation environment that empowers end users to build visually stunning landing pages. They can use a landing page as a link for a call-to-action (CTA) inside emails, to embed forms…","Popup builder: The popup builder is a no-code environment that provides end users with the tools they need to build compelling popups that capture attention.","AI-generated templates: With both Simple Schema and the Convert endpoints, you can build a custom AI-generated content creation experience (for assets such as emails, landing pages, or popups) for your end users.","AI Writing Assistant: A helpful AI assistant to help end users write their design content."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BeefreeSDK/beefree-sdk-docs/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"29346b4ba15de21731b956bfb5257865496f654962fdfe3dad73a87309bf3a58","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:47.638Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:47.638Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Beefree SDK is an embeddable no-code builder that gives your end users the freedom to design stunning emails, landing pages, and popups—without writing a single line of code. It’s easy to configure, intuitive to personalize, and built to scale with your needs—whether you're a startup or an enterprise. Built with both developers and end users in mind, it’s designed to integrate easily into your application, scale as your product grows, and provide a flexible, white-label design experience.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BeefreeSDK/beefree-sdk-docs/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Create an account to access the Developer Console and obtain your credentials.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BeefreeSDK/beefree-sdk-docs/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"29346b4ba15de21731b956bfb5257865496f654962fdfe3dad73a87309bf3a58","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BeefreeSDK/beefree-sdk-docs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:47.639Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T18:55:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BeefreeSDK/beefree-sdk-docs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:47.640Z","hash":"29346b4ba15de21731b956bfb5257865496f654962fdfe3dad73a87309bf3a58","originalBytes":10814,"storedBytes":10814,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["sdk","beefree","end","builder","users","email","no-code","application","create","design","file","how","landing","page","videos","configuration","environment","experience","get","learn","manager","resources","about","available","builders.","client","code","creation","developer","documentation","drag-and-drop","easy","embeddable","explore","following","github","like","popup","quickstart-guides","repository","simple","they","user","which","assets","best","build","code.","console","content","editor","emails","features","feedback","includes","inside","intuitive","option","playground","popups","quickly","sample","standalone","started","technical","test","their","visual-builders","what","ai-generated","any","apis","application.","assistant","beefree-sdk","beefree-sdk-docs","both","builders","built","capture","catalog","check","clone","comprehensive","contribute","creating","custom","customize","designed","designs","developers","discusses","docs.beefree.io","each","easily","email-builder.md","embed","emoji","file-manager","file-manager-applica